.TH sam-jail-profile-change 1 2026-11-23 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-profile\-change \- Change permissions: reads {"from": …, "to": …} (two PermissionSets) on stdin and applies only what differs between them, so changes made elsewhere in the meantime stay. A setting changed elsewhere to another value is refused (code changed\-meanwhile)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail profile change\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change permissions: reads {"from": …, "to": …} (two PermissionSets) on stdin and applies only what differs between them, so changes made elsewhere in the meantime stay. A setting changed elsewhere to another value is refused (code changed\-meanwhile)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm a change that adds something rated Think twice or Dangerous
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

